{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "24780d77-067e-4524-ae90-87dde0265d8f",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_0_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Where is this place?",
                "zh": "这里是哪？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 686.6666870117188,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3a8587d0-4fde-4baf-8a5a-e93c1b7ba1db",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_1_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Uh, I don’t really know, but it should be somewhere near the Yuntai Festival venue.",
                "zh": "呃，我也不认得，但应该是在芸台大会会场附近吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1026.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b67e4d5b-dc7e-4f66-abb0-f86de173ef9e",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_2_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Uh... my head was a mess just now—thanks for telling me about what happened on the plane.",
                "zh": "那个......刚才我脑子有点乱，谢谢你告诉我飞机上的事。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1356.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "04444b97-6862-424d-87dd-3c2b5cbb1081",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_3_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Me too. Thank you for taking me away from there.",
                "zh": "我也是，谢谢你带我离开那里。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1684.6666259765625,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "92f70190-ec84-4e71-b7e7-e26febced394",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_4_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Yeah, but I can’t just leave those people on the plane. Let’s part ways here.",
                "zh": "嗯，但我不能放着飞机上的人不管，我们就在这里分别吧。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2012.0,
            "positionY": 722.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "e4c77733-3522-4c4b-be96-c354f55bf227",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "066100ef-5e3a-4a3f-8313-9da8c2998323",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_5_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "You're going back to that plane?",
                "zh": "你还要回那架飞机上去？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2350.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c46b7c43-cb6e-483a-a049-e9d72dd33cd8",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_6_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ll head to the temple first to see if I can get reinforcements, but I can’t just leave them to die.",
                "zh": "我会先回道观看看能不能搬到救兵，但总归不能放着那些人等死。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2676.0,
            "positionY": 724.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "875f1a67-7152-4d2d-bb7f-063d5ca4a1b1",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "contentId": "Loop1_1_Stewardess_node_4_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "......",
                "zh": "......",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3030.0,
            "positionY": 724.0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "textId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_7_choice_0",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "That you take care, I’ll head off first.",
                        "zh": "那你保重，我先走了。",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                },
                {
                    "textId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_7_choice_1",
                    "text": {
                        "en": "Maybe I can be of help.",
                        "zh": "或许我能帮上忙。",
                        "ja": ""
                    },
                    "conditions": [],
                    "conditionLogic": 0
                }
            ],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "eadce2f4-662a-41dc-90e2-39fe6a608339",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_8_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Take care then, and don’t get seriously hurt like before.",
                "zh": "那你多多保重，千万别像之前一样重伤了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3408.666748046875,
            "positionY": 794.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "f0d22ddd-63ab-42da-8588-66959f51a8f3",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_9_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Haha, I’ll be careful. Uh, at least I'll try figure something out!",
                "zh": "哈哈，我会注意点的。呃，应该会有办法吧！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3758.666748046875,
            "positionY": 794.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a9be2751-6c41-446c-bf22-b4bc239f37a3",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_10_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Okay, I’ve got things to do, see you then",
                "zh": "嗯，我还有事，先走一步了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4096.66650390625,
            "positionY": 792.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "8826ae8e-9920-4ff9-9e82-85d3116a6047",
            "index": 11,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_11_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Alrighty, hope we can still meet at the Yuntai Festival.",
                "zh": "好嘞，但愿我们芸台大会时还能见到。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4456.0,
            "positionY": 794.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "3d2bc0f8-128e-4c1b-b309-eed89d51723b",
            "index": 12,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_12_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Oh right! Wait I haven’t asked your name yet.",
                "zh": "对了，还没问过你的名字来着。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4800.66650390625,
            "positionY": 794.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "351209b3-113b-4a5d-9c8c-14618f1bcc23",
            "index": 13,
            "characterId": "c5690423-74d1-4bca-8967-89da828b1a25",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_13_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Just call me Veris.",
                "zh": "我叫何以真。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5140.0,
            "positionY": 794.6666870117188,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "b5debbea-d82c-4f1f-bf1a-f8145e968ebf",
            "index": 14,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_14_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Well! Then, goodbye,Veris.",
                "zh": "那么，再会了，何以真。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5470.0,
            "positionY": 794.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [
                {
