        {
            "id": "fd429be0-c905-493e-87b7-d9284bbc5d80",
            "index": 16,
            "characterId": "7a570009-3eab-4a2f-b216-90c158cfb04f",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_16_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Huh?",
                "zh": "啊？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 3758.666748046875,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "13338727-3834-40b8-8e6c-2ff1080a2177",
            "index": 17,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_17_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "I gathered some information over the last two loops. Isn’t this near the Yuntai Festival venue?",
                "zh": "我通过前两个循环收集了一些信息，这里不是芸台大会附近吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4096.66650390625,
            "positionY": 1197.3333740234375,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "84847ec2-57c5-417d-980e-f65fdc05fffe",
            "index": 18,
            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_18_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Maybe I can ask around here and find a way to resolve this.",
                "zh": "或许我可以在这里打听一下，看看能不能找到破局的方法。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4456.0,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9484dbaa-7ad9-437d-8534-44d6a5fe32ee",
            "index": 19,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_19_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Wow! That’s amazing! I’m really bad at anything that requires thinking!",
                "zh": "天呐！你真是太好了！我最不擅长需要动脑子的事情了！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 4800.66650390625,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "2eb1774e-489c-4f49-977c-d8c4b8989245",
            "index": 20,
            "characterId": "9bf1f67d-ba62-4b57-a9cc-3ce252972f0f",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_20_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "(Um, but isn’t your name Page?)",
                "zh": "（呃，但你的名字不是叫周书吗？）",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5140.0,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "769f424a-1fa5-41ca-80b6-464559072f5e",
            "index": 21,
            "characterId": "91eae646-d3d2-46e9-9336-e09e16836545",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_21_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Are you wondering why I’m called Page?",
                "zh": "你是不是在想为啥我叫周书？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5470.0,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "458250e0-f463-4715-9bba-157e1c8a53a5",
            "index": 22,
            "characterId": "1a519e99-26bd-4cf6-a1eb-a6e92ba8abe5",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_22_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Haha, it’s because my master thought I was a bit slow, so she gave me that name on purpose!",
                "zh": "哈哈，就是因为我师父嫌我脑袋瓜不灵光，特意给我起的！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 5812.0,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "fa309f3c-905f-4cd2-aa11-c04997fd0db1",
            "index": 23,
            "characterId": "481038d5-cf0b-4d90-b374-cf1fd0c406cd",
            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_23_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "She’s always hoped I’d smarten up one day, but I think that’s unlikely.",
                "zh": "她一直希望我哪天能开窍，但我觉得够呛了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 6141.3330078125,
            "positionY": 1198.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
