            "contentId": "Loop3_2_Start_node_28_dialogue",
            "content": {
                "en": "Okay, gather as much info as I can—find a way to solve the incident on the plane!",
                "zh": "好，尽可能多收集信息，找到解决飞机上事件的办法！",
